        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCSOL19ENTR, Single Cylinder Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate Single Cylinder Entryset has a contemporary southwest feel that makes it a great addition to any front door. It is available in a wide array of finish colors including polished brass, satin nickel, and timeless bronze. The Single Cylinder Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset is 11 inches tall and 2.5 inches wide, the perfect fit for any door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/soleil-knob-with-arc-tall-plate-grandeur-arcsol19\"><b>Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCSOL19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262396\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCSOL19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
